## 4. Slice conclusion

Within the pasted proofs, the by-finite-level laws are genuinely formulated over an arbitrary complete DVR with finite residue field. Their load-bearing calculations use only finite-field linear independence and censuses, discrete valuation/Newton-polygon and residual-polynomial algebra, monic division/carry bookkeeping, and completeness/Hensel-type lifting. The notes explicitly repair the dangerous gauge, nonmaximal-order, partial-slot, window-boundary, and characteristic-two seams. I found no mathematical step that breaks for \(\mathbf F_q[[t]]\), and no use of \(v(p)\), characteristic zero, Witt/Teichmüller structure, or unlicensed separability. Full certification of the slice nevertheless stops at one H6 item: GENHN’s bare “Ore order-1” supplier has no checkable published scope in the pasted material. All other unresolved dependencies are named interfaces, not evidence of a mixed-characteristic obstruction.

